# The build context is this directory, and open-webui-data/ holds multi-GB
# runtime state (HF model cache for bge-m3, uploads, vector_db, webui.db).
# Nothing in Dockerfile.open-webui copies it, but sending it as context on
# every `compose up --build` is pure I/O and a real ENOSPC risk on the small
# AI host. functions/ is source, yet it is bind-mounted by the app, not baked
# into the image, so the whole directory stays out of the build.
open-webui-data/
